You are working on the game in the **`hiyroscript/shkr`** repository: a single-file rhythm runner (`index.html`, ~2,590 lines, no build step, no dependencies), plus a design-brief file named `max`. The game is currently branded **LUMBRA**. Rebrand it completely to **Shadow Skirr**.

**The repository stays named `shkr`.** Do not rename the repo, do not rename `index.html` or `max`, and do not change any reference to other repos (e.g. `hiyroscript/vl`). This is a name/identity change only: gameplay, levels, physics, audio, art style, layout and UI behaviour must be unchanged.

